@API = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# Change this based on the user returned from login
@USER_ID = 8
@NEW_USER_ID = 999 
@NON_EXISTENT_ID = 999999

################################################ Auth #######################################

### 1. Login (Sets HTTP-Only Cookies)
POST {{API}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user7@gmail.com",
  "password": "abdellahnsila123#002"
}

############################################## Profile ######################################

### 2. Standard Happy Path (User with clubs, matches, and ranks)
GET {{API}}/users/{{USER_ID}}/profile

### 3. Edge Case: Brand New User (Zero clubs, zero matches)
# Expectation: Should return 200 OK. memberProfile arrays should be [], stats should be 0.
GET {{API}}/users/{{NEW_USER_ID}}/profile

### 4. Edge Case: Non-Existent User
# Expectation: Auth service throws RPC exception -> Gateway translates to 404 Not Found.
GET {{API}}/users/{{NON_EXISTENT_ID}}/profile

### 5. Edge Case: Invalid Parameter Type (String/UUID instead of Int)
# Expectation: ValidationPipe should catch this -> 400 Bad Request.
GET {{API}}/users/not-a-number/profile

### 6. Edge Case: Rate Limiting Test (Spam this request)
# Expectation: After REQUEST_LIMIT hits, returns 429 Too Many Requests.
GET {{API}}/users/{{USER_ID}}/profile